<p>A drone strike launched from Sudan killed 17 people in the Chadian border town of Tiné, according to Chadian officials. Local residents said the dead included mourners at a funeral and children playing nearby. The attack happened late on March 18, and Chad described it as a cross-border assault on civilians, underscoring how Sudan’s war is spilling into neighboring territory. Chadian President Idriss Mahamat Déby responded by putting the military on high alert, ordering the border with Sudan closed, and warning that Chad would retaliate against any further attacks. The strike adds to regional strain around Sudan’s civil war, which has already pushed violence, refugees, and insecurity beyond Sudan’s borders. One small positive sign is that the attack drew a swift official response and renewed attention to protecting civilians in the frontier area.</p><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Chadian government: Officials said the victims were civilians and described the strike as an attack launched from Sudan onto Chadian territory. (<a href='https://www.dw.com/en/chad-says-17-killed-in-sudanese-drone-attack/a-76432675'>Deutsche Welle</a>)</li><li>President Idriss Mahamat Déby: Déby warned that Chad would respond to any further attacks and ordered the military to heighten readiness along the border. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c0mjn0g708ro'>BBC News</a>)</li><li>Local residents in Tiné: Residents said the casualties included funeral mourners and children playing near the strike site. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/19/drone-attack-from-sudan-kills-17-in-chad-as-conflict-spills-over'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/19/drone-attack-from-sudan-kills-17-in-chad-as-conflict-spills-over'>Drone attack from Sudan kills 17 people in Chad as war spills over border</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/chad-says-17-killed-in-sudanese-drone-attack/a-76432675'>Chad says 17 killed in Sudanese drone attack</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/drone-attack-from-sudan-kills-17-in-chad-chadian-government-says'>Drone attack from Sudan kills 17 in Chad, Chadian government says</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c0mjn0g708ro'>Chad warns Sudan it will retaliate after drone strike on mourners kills 17</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theeastafrican.co.ke/tea/news/north-africa/drone-attack-from-sudan-kills-17-in-chad-chad-government-says-5396298'>Government officials in Chad announce that 17 people have been killed following a drone strike from Sudan at a funeral late Wednesday in the border town of Tiné.</a> - theeastafrican.co.ke</li></ul>